such as the sun and the moon.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:23.570
Well, of course, if we're talking
about the sun or the moon.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.200
I see.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.240
"NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI"
"MICHIRU FUKUROI"

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.160
"NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI"
"MICHIRU FUKUROI"

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.160
You can't possibly be thinking about
incorporating a stupid opinion.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:28.910
You can't possibly be thinking about
incorporating a stupid opinion.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:33.880
No, Michiru. That was simply
an opinion given by a stupid person,

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.840
so it is not, in the least,
a stupid opinion.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.840
"HYOTA ASHIKAGA"

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.840
What do you mean, Nagahiro?

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.340
Well, one new theory has been born.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:43.260
There's something I'd like to research.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.720
Miss Dojima.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.560
In any case, when you return home,

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.890
