our leader just gave to your parents.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:53.560
And can you please come to
the Art Room once again after school?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.820
Perhaps we may be able
to give you some good news.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.740
Don't get your hopes up too high, Dojima.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:06.740
He may seem pretty decent among us,

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:10.700
but he's got a Lolita complex
and dating a first grader.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.750
No need to fear.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.630
If you put aside his Lolita complex,

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.460
Nagahiro is a good guy
who's hard to find nowadays.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.340
Oh no, no.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.130
That's a characteristic that no matter how
precise of a surgical procedure is used,

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.510
"LOLITA COMPLEX"

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.510
That's a characteristic that no matter how
precise of a surgical procedure is used,

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:26.140
"LOLITA COMPLEX"

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.470
Ahem.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:30.060
She's not my significant other,
but a fiancÃ©e.

