One that my parents
arranged without telling me.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.850
You're fully aware of that, Captain.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:35.980
However...

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:41.900
When he said not to get your hopes up...
That part may be true.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.400
"REMARKS AND SHADOWING"

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.160
"DOJIMA"

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.160
I was easily able to convince my parents.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.620
I was easily able to convince my parents.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:51.370
The deadline for our promise
was extended until sunset today.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.870
I forgot my glasses.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.380
I'm screwed.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.600
I saw it.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.100
Anyways, I need to hurry to school.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.600
But I can't walk too fast, either.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:26.530
Two people?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:28.570
