00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:30.700
Wow, I'm really popular, huh?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:36.750
Sheesh, sheesh, sheesh, sheesh!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.600
I don't understand.
I don't even have time to ponder that!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.730
