the incident quietly came to an end.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:02.020
"WITNESS"

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.780
What's going to happen to me?

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:08.110
Will I be kidnapped?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.070
Will I be erased?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.370
Nothing's going to happen.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.540
Because we're here with you.
Nothing will happen.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.580
Am I wrong, Nagahiro?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.540
No matter who we're up against,
it doesn't matter. I mean, it's us.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:24.550
Yes, of course.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:28.170
No matter what kind of circumstances
the adults have, it doesn't matter.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.550
We are boys.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.350
What is up with these people?

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:38.680
How can they be laughing
in a situation like this?

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.690
The Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.730
Oh no. I'm so happy.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:49.860
I'm so happy that they'll stay with me.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:52.820
I'm so happy that they'll stay on my side.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.080
So realistically,
should I be contacting the police?

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.920
They'd scoff at you and that'd be it.

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.920
If you tell them, "I witnessed
a military satellite being shot down

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.630
with a nuke ten years ago,"

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:12.130
I don't think they'd ever believe you.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.510
It's not like you have evidence, right?

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.140
If you don't have evidence,
why not make some?

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:21.270
At the very least, you being chased
this morning is the truth.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:22.230
S-Sure.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:26.400
That's why if we can instead capture
at least one guy from their side,

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.570
that would be living proof right there.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:29.820
Y-Yeah.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:31.820
That's a dangerous plan.

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.740
I'm sure they'll be on alert
for someone tailing the tailer.

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.280
There's also the possibility
that they're armed.

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:37.990
Armed.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.290
Then let me do this.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.210
I'm here for times like this, right?

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:49.380
No, you're here because
the food you make is tasty.

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.920
Rest assured, boys.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.670
I have a secret tactic.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:54.010
"SECRET TACTIC"

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.550
I see.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.390
The good kids will head to class.

00:16:58.390 --> 00:17:00.470
The bad kids will proceed
with the secret tactic.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:01.310
"MANABU SOTOIN"
"SOSAKU YUBIWA"
"HYOTA ASHIKAGA"
"MAYUMI DOJIMA"

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:02.060
"THE BAD KIDS"

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.850
Basically, we'll follow
the plan that Hyota devised.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.810
We'll have those guys lose track of you.

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:12.360
My plan is to capture them when
they become restless and panic.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:16.660
But they probably figured out
what school I go to already.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.240
Mayumi Dojima, who do you think we are?

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.120
Like I'd know. Who are you guys?

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.620
Get a hold of yourself.
We're the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:29.670
The third rule of Pretty Boy
Detective Club, "Be a detective."

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.840
And when you hear "detective,"
what do you think of?

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.880
Like I'd know. What is it?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.970
When you hear "detective,"
of course you think of disguises!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:40.350
It's your turn, Sosaku! Finish her up!

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.390
I'm going to be finished up?

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:44.850
"THE ART SQUAD OF
THE PRETTY BOY DETECTIVE CLUB"

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.610
He finished me up.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:53.940
Th-This is me?

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.900
I thought you hated beautiful people.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.780
I-I hate them. I absolutely hate them.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:02.660
Gosh, I hate that I turned
into something like this.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:06.540
But it's not worth losing my life over,
so I'll bear with it for today.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.040
This is no good.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.040
Absolutely no good!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.840
Wh-What part of this is no good, Sotoin?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.800
This is too beautiful, Sosaku!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.260
I've always been telling you that
your skills are your biggest merit

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.720
but also your only flaw!

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:22.640
It'd be fine if this pretty boy
has a quirk or two like us,

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.730
but if such an orthodox pretty boy

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.980
was walking home from school without
a girl at his side, it'd be strange!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:30.020
You'll draw attention instead.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.610
Oh, you leave me no choice.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:36.990
It's the leader's job to follow up
with a member's failure, I mean success.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:40.910
I will lend a helping hand, then.
A necessity has been created.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.740
I'll have to ask you for one
more job, Sosaku!

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.950
"BEST COUPLE"

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:52.210
"* THIS IS MANABU"

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:00.090
Hey, Sotoin. Can I ask you a question?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.510
Only if that question is beautiful.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.890
Why do you go this far?

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:06.390
Wouldn't it be more wise

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:10.520
to retreat at this point for
the Pretty Boy Detective Club?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:15.940
I see. I didn't think of that idea, but
that is indeed a wise way to tackle this.

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:18.990
However, that is not
a beautiful way to do it.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.740
That goes against my sense
of aestheticism.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.160
Rest assured, Mayumi Dojima.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:29.290
We don't protect our confidentiality,
but we do protect our clients.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:32.790
A pretty boy, no, a pretty girl
said something like that to me,

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:35.880
and I got this indescribable feeling.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.220
You could say I was embarrassed,
or that I felt miserable.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.010
They've tailored me up to be so beautiful,

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.510
and was finished up
to look like a pretty boy.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:46.770
But in the end,
the person inside me is still the same me.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.020
It's just like Cinderella.

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.480
You know how they often say

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:56.820
when Cinderella dressed up
with the old lady's magic,

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:59.110
and the prince fell in love
with her at the ball,

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.110
and he sought her out
with the glass slipper as the clue.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:05.910
But she didn't do anything.
She's a very passive princess.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.200
I don't think Cinderella did
absolutely nothing.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.540
The days of hardship she endured under
the care of her malicious stepmother

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:15.340
should be more than enough for a reward.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:18.130
There would be something wrong
if she wasn't rewarded.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:19.130
Likewise,

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:22.180
all these days in the past ten years
that you've spent searching for the star

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.890
will not be a waste, either.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:28.350
We, who you've met as a result of that,
will never let it go to waste.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.850
You will definitely be rewarded.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:34.100
Even if that star doesn't exist.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.900
By the way, if I were to say more
about the story of Cinderella,

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.280
there's a question for the dress
and pumpkin carriage magic

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:43.160
being undone at the stroke of midnight,

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:48.580
but the glass slippers didn't
disappear along with them.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.370
But in my opinion, I don't come across
such a foolish question that often.

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:57.840
Of course, that is a clever arrangement
made by the Fairy Godmother!

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:01.720
Just because she was dressed up,
just because she was put on a carriage,

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:04.430
and just because she was
simply decorated superficially,

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:06.470
Cinderella carried a beautiful spirit

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.810
and went into
the flamboyant ball at the castle.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.970
And if that doesn't deserve any rewards...

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:13.770
then what in the world
would count as magic?

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.360
"MISSION FAILURE"

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:21.280
In any case, we faked a
pretty-boy-and-girl couple

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.320
and got past the group surrounding us.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:25.410
I think. Probably.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:29.030
But still, you are rather sensitive.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.040
Normally, you can't tell
whether or not you're being tailed.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.790
I'd never be able to notice.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:37.920
Well, girls are a bit more sensitive
about things like that compared to boys.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:39.340
Is that so?

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:44.880
Well, because of your senses, that's why
you witnessed a satellite being shot down.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:50.390
"KAMIKAZARI JR HIGH"

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.230
--Is something wrong?
--Let's change cour--

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.730
--Wow, seriously?
--That's crazy!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.870
I see.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:11.120
Th-Thank you. You saved us.

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.740
It's fine.

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:16.420
I had first dibs on you anyway.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:21.000
"The Dark Star that Shines
for You Alone (Part 2)"
